Alas, I haven't even looked since June, so I never noticed.

>And it will be updated roughly bi-weekly; whenever something
>occurs worth noting.

That is also supposed to be the purpose of the Lojban announce list, but we 
have yet to have decided anything is worth such an announcement.  If you 
can come up with one item every 2 weeks, that would be a reasonably nice 
rate I think.

>If Robin Powell wants to use this as the front page of lojban.org, that's
